                                "sense_id": "3dcc574e-7c03-3612-85fe-94b3e67186e6",
                                "text": "But Private Angelo is considered to be Britain's first filmset commercially distributed book."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8d7a0be2-5e8f-425d-ab0b-194f20303521",
                                "sense_id": "3dcc574e-7c03-3612-85fe-94b3e67186e6",
                                "text": "To some extent the actual thickness of the filmset letters can be controlled to suit differing paper surfaces."
